 "Чему равен периметр фигуры, составленной из C, D, C, D и T?": "<figure class='st'><svg style='max-width:230px' viewBox='-8 -67.8 106 301.9' role='img' aria-label='Рисунок условия: сетка 4 на 4 из прямоугольников A, B, C, D, сверху треугольник E, снизу треугольник T'><g fill='none' stroke='#cfdae6' stroke-width='0.8'><rect x='0' y='0' width='21' height='30'/><rect x='21' y='0' width='24' height='30'/><rect x='45' y='0' width='21' height='30'/><rect x='66' y='0' width='24' height='30'/><rect x='0' y='30' width='21' height='39'/><rect x='21' y='30' width='24' height='39'/><rect x='45' y='30' width='21' height='39'/><rect x='66' y='30' width='24' height='39'/><rect x='0' y='69' width='21' height='30'/><rect x='21' y='69' width='24' height='30'/><rect x='45' y='69' width='21' height='30'/><rect x='66' y='69' width='24' height='30'/><rect x='0' y='99' width='21' height='39'/><rect x='21' y='99' width='24' height='39'/><rect x='45' y='99' width='21' height='39'/><rect x='66' y='99' width='24' height='39'/></g><g fill='#e8eef6' font-size='9' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='10.5' y='18.1'>A</text><text x='33' y='18.1'>B</text><text x='55.5' y='18.1'>A</text><text x='78' y='18.1'>B</text><text x='10.5' y='52.6'>C</text><text x='33' y='52.6'>D</text><text x='55.5' y='52.6'>C</text><text x='78' y='52.6'>D</text><text x='10.5' y='87.2'>A</text><text x='33' y='87.2'>B</text><text x='55.5' y='87.2'>A</text><text x='78' y='87.2'>B</text><text x='10.5' y='121.7'>C</text><text x='33' y='121.7'>D</text><text x='55.5' y='121.7'>C</text><text x='78' y='121.7'>D</text></g><path fill='none' stroke='#cfdae6' stroke-width='0.8' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M21 0L55.5 -59.8L90 0'/><text x='55.5' y='-22.7' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='10' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>E</text><path fill='none' stroke='#cfdae6' stroke-width='0.8' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M0 138L45 226.2L90 138'/><text x='45' y='171.5' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='10' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>T</text></svg><figcaption>Рисунок из условия. Четыре ряда: «A B A B», «C D C D», «A B A B», «C D C D». Треугольник E стоит не на всей верхней стороне, а только на трёх правых деталях «B, A, B»; треугольник T подпирает снизу всю нижнюю сторону.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Одна и та же ширина стоит в условии трижды": "<figure class='st'><div class='fgrid2'><div class='cell'><svg style='max-width:230px' viewBox='-18 -67.8 120 158.8' role='img' aria-label='Сторона E равна ширине полосы B, A, B'><g fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.6'><rect x='0' y='0' width='21' height='30'/><rect x='21' y='0' width='24' height='30'/><rect x='45' y='0' width='21' height='30'/><rect x='66' y='0' width='24' height='30'/><rect x='0' y='30' width='21' height='39'/><rect x='21' y='30' width='24' height='39'/><rect x='45' y='30' width='21' height='39'/><rect x='66' y='30' width='24' height='39'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='10.5' y='17.8'>A</text><text x='33' y='17.8'>B</text><text x='55.5' y='17.8'>A</text><text x='78' y='17.8'>B</text><text x='10.5' y='52.3'>C</text><text x='33' y='52.3'>D</text><text x='55.5' y='52.3'>C</text><text x='78' y='52.3'>D</text></g><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.6' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M21 0L55.5 -59.8L90 0'/><text x='55.5' y='-22.7' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='10' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>E</text><path fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='0.6' stroke-dasharray='2 2' d='M0 69V79M90 69V79'/><path fill='none' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M21 0L55.5 -59.8L90 0Z'/><rect x='21' y='0' width='69' height='30' fill='#f0a83c' fill-opacity='.12' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.4'/><path fill='none' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='0.7' d='M21 76.5V81.5M21 79H90M90 76.5V81.5'/><text x='55.5' y='89' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='7' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>a + 2b</text><text x='35' y='-32.9' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6' text-anchor='end' font-weight='600'>a + 2b</text></svg><p class='ccap'>Основание E — это верх полосы «B, A, B». Все три стороны E равны этой ширине, и она же — длинная сторона блока «B, A, B».</p></div><div class='cell'><svg style='max-width:230px' viewBox='-18 -67.8 120 158.8' role='img' aria-label='Квадрат из B, A, B, D, C, D: ширина равна высоте'><g fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.6'><rect x='0' y='0' width='21' height='30'/><rect x='21' y='0' width='24' height='30'/><rect x='45' y='0' width='21' height='30'/><rect x='66' y='0' width='24' height='30'/><rect x='0' y='30' width='21' height='39'/><rect x='21' y='30' width='24' height='39'/><rect x='45' y='30' width='21' height='39'/><rect x='66' y='30' width='24' height='39'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='10.5' y='17.8'>A</text><text x='33' y='17.8'>B</text><text x='55.5' y='17.8'>A</text><text x='78' y='17.8'>B</text><text x='10.5' y='52.3'>C</text><text x='33' y='52.3'>D</text><text x='55.5' y='52.3'>C</text><text x='78' y='52.3'>D</text></g><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.6' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M21 0L55.5 -59.8L90 0'/><text x='55.5' y='-22.7' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='10' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>E</text><path fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='0.6' stroke-dasharray='2 2' d='M0 69V79M90 69V79'/><rect x='21' y='0' width='69' height='69' fill='#f0a83c' fill-opacity='.12' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.4'/><path fill='none' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='0.7' d='M21 76.5V81.5M21 79H90M90 76.5V81.5'/><text x='55.5' y='89' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='7' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>a + 2b</text><path fill='none' stroke='#93a1b1' stroke-width='0.7' d='M-10.5 0H-5.5M-8 0V30M-10.5 30H-5.5'/><text x='-13' y='17.5' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='7' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>p</text><path fill='none' stroke='#93a1b1' stroke-width='0.7' d='M-10.5 30H-5.5M-8 30V69M-10.5 69H-5.5'/><text x='-13' y='52' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='7' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>q</text><text x='55.5' y='-4' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>квадрат</text></svg><p class='ccap'>Квадрат «B, A, B, D, C, D» стоит на той же полосе: его ширина — снова <b>a + 2b</b>, а высота — два ряда, <b>p + q</b>.</p></div></div><figcaption>Периметр E сообщает ширину полосы «B, A, B» сразу, без всяких уравнений. А эта ширина — готовый кусок и в периметре блока «B, A, B», и в стороне квадрата: из первого выйдет p, из второго потом q.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Каждый спрошенный периметр — тоже обход": "<figure class='st'><div class='fgrid2'><div class='cell'><svg style='max-width:230px' viewBox='-30 -16 132 162' role='img' aria-label='Блок A, B, C, D, A, B'><g fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.6'><rect x='0' y='0' width='21' height='30'/><rect x='21' y='0' width='24' height='30'/><rect x='45' y='0' width='21' height='30'/><rect x='66' y='0' width='24' height='30'/><rect x='0' y='30' width='21' height='39'/><rect x='21' y='30' width='24' height='39'/><rect x='45' y='30' width='21' height='39'/><rect x='66' y='30' width='24' height='39'/><rect x='0' y='69' width='21' height='30'/><rect x='21' y='69' width='24' height='30'/><rect x='45' y='69' width='21' height='30'/><rect x='66' y='69' width='24' height='30'/><rect x='0' y='99' width='21' height='39'/><rect x='21' y='99' width='24' height='39'/><rect x='45' y='99' width='21' height='39'/><rect x='66' y='99' width='24' height='39'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='10.5' y='17.8'>A</text><text x='33' y='17.8'>B</text><text x='55.5' y='17.8'>A</text><text x='78' y='17.8'>B</text><text x='10.5' y='52.3'>C</text><text x='33' y='52.3'>D</text><text x='55.5' y='52.3'>C</text><text x='78' y='52.3'>D</text><text x='10.5' y='86.8'>A</text><text x='33' y='86.8'>B</text><text x='55.5' y='86.8'>A</text><text x='78' y='86.8'>B</text><text x='10.5' y='121.3'>C</text><text x='33' y='121.3'>D</text><text x='55.5' y='121.3'>C</text><text x='78' y='121.3'>D</text></g><rect x='0' y='0' width='45' height='99' fill='#f0a83c' fill-opacity='.12' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.4'/><path fill='none' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='0.7' d='M0 -9.5V-4.5M0 -7H45M45 -9.5V-4.5'/><text x='22.5' y='-10' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='7' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>a + b</text><path fill='none' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='0.7' d='M-10.5 0H-5.5M-8 0V99M-10.5 99H-5.5'/><text x='-11' y='52' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6' text-anchor='end' font-weight='600'>2p + q</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>P(блока «A, B, C, D, A, B»)</b> = 2 · ((a + b) + (2p + q)) — две колонки, три ряда.</p></div><div class='cell'><svg style='max-width:230px' viewBox='-30 -14 146 248.2' role='img' aria-label='Фигура C, D, C, D и T'><g fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.6'><rect x='0' y='0' width='21' height='30'/><rect x='21' y='0' width='24' height='30'/><rect x='45' y='0' width='21' height='30'/><rect x='66' y='0' width='24' height='30'/><rect x='0' y='30' width='21' height='39'/><rect x='21' y='30' width='24' height='39'/><rect x='45' y='30' width='21' height='39'/><rect x='66' y='30' width='24' height='39'/><rect x='0' y='69' width='21' height='30'/><rect x='21' y='69' width='24' height='30'/><rect x='45' y='69' width='21' height='30'/><rect x='66' y='69' width='24' height='30'/><rect x='0' y='99' width='21' height='39'/><rect x='21' y='99' width='24' height='39'/><rect x='45' y='99' width='21' height='39'/><rect x='66' y='99' width='24' height='39'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='10.5' y='17.8'>A</text><text x='33' y='17.8'>B</text><text x='55.5' y='17.8'>A</text><text x='78' y='17.8'>B</text><text x='10.5' y='52.3'>C</text><text x='33' y='52.3'>D</text><text x='55.5' y='52.3'>C</text><text x='78' y='52.3'>D</text><text x='10.5' y='86.8'>A</text><text x='33' y='86.8'>B</text><text x='55.5' y='86.8'>A</text><text x='78' y='86.8'>B</text><text x='10.5' y='121.3'>C</text><text x='33' y='121.3'>D</text><text x='55.5' y='121.3'>C</text><text x='78' y='121.3'>D</text></g><rect x='0' y='0' width='21' height='99' fill='#5ba8f5' fill-opacity='.14' stroke='#5ba8f5' stroke-width='1'/><path fill='none' stroke='#5ba8f5' stroke-width='0.7' d='M-10.5 0H-5.5M-8 0V99M-10.5 99H-5.5'/><text x='-11' y='52' fill='#5ba8f5' font-size='6' text-anchor='end' font-weight='600'>2p + q</text><path fill='none' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M0 138V99H90V138L45 226.2Z'/><path fill='none' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='0.8' stroke-dasharray='2 2' opacity='.6' d='M0 138H90'/><text x='45' y='173.3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='9' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>T</text><text x='-3' y='182.1' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6' text-anchor='end' font-weight='600'>2p + q</text><text x='93' y='182.1' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>2p + q</text><text x='93' y='120.5' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>q</text><text x='-3' y='120.5' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6' text-anchor='end' font-weight='600'>q</text><text x='45' y='96' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>2a + 2b</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>P(фигуры «C, D, C, D, T»)</b> = (2a + 2b) + 2q + 2 · (2p + q). Основание T прилегает к ряду изнутри и в контур не входит.</p></div></div><figcaption>Бок T по условию равен длинной стороне колонны «A, C, A» (синяя): это три верхних ряда, p + q + p. Та же длина — высота левого блока.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Каждое данное — обход контура по рисунку": "<figure class='st fx'><div class='fgrid2'><div class='cell'><svg style='max-width:230px' viewBox='-26 -68 132 146' role='img' aria-label='Контур E'><g fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.6'><rect x='0' y='0' width='21' height='30'/><rect x='21' y='0' width='24' height='30'/><rect x='45' y='0' width='21' height='30'/><rect x='66' y='0' width='24' height='30'/><rect x='0' y='30' width='21' height='39'/><rect x='21' y='30' width='24' height='39'/><rect x='45' y='30' width='21' height='39'/><rect x='66' y='30' width='24' height='39'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='10.5' y='17.8'>A</text><text x='33.0' y='17.8'>B</text><text x='55.5' y='17.8'>A</text><text x='78.0' y='17.8'>B</text><text x='10.5' y='52.3'>C</text><text x='33.0' y='52.3'>D</text><text x='55.5' y='52.3'>C</text><text x='78.0' y='52.3'>D</text></g><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.6' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M21 0L55.5 -59.8L90 0'/><text x='55.5' y='-22.7' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='10' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>E</text><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.4' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M21 0L55.5 -59.8L90 0Z'/><text x='33' y='-32' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6.5' text-anchor='end' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:0.8s'>a + 2b</text><text x='78' y='-32' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6.5' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.4s'>a + 2b</text><text x='55.5' y='-3' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6.5' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:2.0s'>a + 2b</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>(1)</b> P(E) = 207</p></div><div class='cell'><svg style='max-width:230px' viewBox='-26 -68 132 146' role='img' aria-label='Контур блока A, B, A'><g fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.6'><rect x='0' y='0' width='21' height='30'/><rect x='21' y='0' width='2